es is correct?"}, {"y0": 0.33866279095306284, "y1": 0.3533333334677483, "x0": 0.18984962923683502, "x1": 0.40977443641166117, "t": "(A) | Both P and Q are true."}, {"y0": 0.3866279071594583, "y1": 0.40116279036961155, "x0": 0.19172932424616065, "x1": 0.2218045110921852, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.3866279072321326, "y1": 0.4012121214137436, "x0": 0.23120301314613678, "x1": 0.4116541342222842, "t": "P is true and Q is false."}, {"y0": 0.43313953483136913, "y1": 0.44912790670932845, "x0": 0.18984962362899535, "x1": 0.2218045115213806, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.4345454544083813, "y1": 0.44787878774171475, "x0": 0.23496240319141587, "x1": 0.4097744330867798, "t": "P is false and Q is true."}, {"y0": 0.4825581398525647, "y1": 0.49709302306271796, "x0": 0.18984962349473108, "x1": 0.22180451138711635, "t": "(D)"}, {"y0": 0.4840116283440512, "y1": 0.4987878790098894, "x0": 0.2349624065043857, "x1": 0.4097744363997496, "t": "Both P and Q are false."}, {"y0": 0.5784883721071167, "y1": 0.594476743985076, "x0": 0.16165413528531808, "x1": 0.20300751944078285, "t": "Q.33"}, {"y0": 0.5799418605181424, "y1": 0.5959302323961018, "x0": 0.23308271181517, "x1": 0.83834587474498, "t": "A bag has r red balls and 6 black balls. All balls are identical except for their"}, {"y0": 0.5957575760020304, "y1": 0.6104651158783324, "x0": 0.23496241193891426, "x1": 0.8383458738223635, "t": "colours. In a trial, a ball is randomly drawn from the bag, its colour is noted and"}, {"y0": 0.6119186050786326, "y1": 0.62499999962098, "x0": 0.23496241445301191, "x1": 0.8383458763364612, "t": "the ball is placed back into the bag along with another ball of the same colour."}, {"y0": 0.6278787880376784, "y1": 0.6424418601266714, "x0": 0.2349624095921968, "x1": 0.8364661704292854, "t": "Note that the number of balls in the bag will increase by one, after the trial. A"}, {"y0": 0.6436363634583766, "y1": 0.659999999822013, "x0": 0.2312029965128547, "x1": 0.8383458604890253, "t": "sequence of four such trials is conducted. Which one of the following choices gives"}, {"y0": 0.6581818179159475, "y1": 0.6758720932816036, "x0": 0.231203023710165, "x1": 0.6466165244571281, "t": "the probability of drawing a red ball in the fourth trial?"}, {"y0": 0.7049418602042608, "y1": 0.723837209417832, "x0": 0.18609022597620042, "x1": 0.21992481192537172, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.7572674419945592, "y1": 0.7747093025403244, "x0": 0.18984962458450652, "x1": 0.21992481143053108, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.7558139537103009, "y1": 0.7805232552831584, "x0": 0.23120300647000594, "x1": 0.28947368509484367, "t": "176+3"}, {"y0": 0.8139534885522994, "y1": 0.8299418604302587, "x0": 0.18796992415531114, "x1": 0.2199248120476964, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.8095930235282449, "y1": 0.8226744180705923, "x0": 0.23872180465429213, "x1": 0.2763157897066102, "t": "T+3"}, {"y0": 0.8226744188164676, "y1": 0.8328488371791718, "x0": 0.2387218038676772, "x1": 0.28571428518307473, "t": "r+b+3"}, {"y0": 0.8633720936147821, "y1": 0.8927272722165961, "x0": 0.22744360608250158, "x1": 0.5300751875474066, "t": "(7) (t11) (7t22) (7033)"}, {"y0": 0.8691860462968849, "y1": 0.8866279068426501, "x0": 0.18796992438087504, "x1": 0.2199248122732603, "t": "(D)"}, {"y0": 0.946060606178771, "y1": 0.9607558136012008, "x0": 0.15225564383144577, "x1": 0.3966165406923637, "t": "CS, Set-2 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9461479319966045, "y1": 0.9593753242510582, "x0": 0.75374250055543, "x1": 0.847761257338177, "t": "Page 28 of 43"}]